      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Wouldn't it be enough to put a hash of the installer on the download site?\n\nIMO verifying the integrity / signature via a public key (à la TailsOS) would be overkill for VCC.\n\nPS: The current sha256 hash for VRChat_CreatorCompanion_Setup_2.1.6.exe would be: c21ecb446275f06e71321b0617a4569f0c6be8fe47bda44295ca5f29312089e8",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
